<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Areas of Focus — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#FEFAF3;--card:#FFFFFF;--accent:#6C4A2B;--muted:#7B6B60;--accent-2:#D6B78B;--ink:#2E2A25}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}
    header{padding:18px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(46,42,37,0.06)}
    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:18px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    nav a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:10px}
    h1{color:var(--accent);margin:0 0 8px}
    h3{margin:10px 0 6px}
    p{margin:0}
    ul{margin:8px 0 0 18px}

    /* pricing style */
    .tiers{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}
    .tier{flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(46,42,37,0.06)}
    .tier h4{margin:0 0 6px}
    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px}

    .widget{margin-top:12px}
    input,select,textarea{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(46,42,37,0.08)}
    button.primary{background:var(--accent);color:white;border:none;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}
    .output{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#FFF9F2;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px dashed rgba(46,42,37,0.06);margin-top:8px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="specialties.html">Areas</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
        <a href="fees.html">Fees</a>
        <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
        <a href="book.html">Start</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <h1>Areas of focus</h1>
    <p class="muted">I offer steady clinical partnership across several common concerns for adults. Below are concise descriptions to help you decide if we might be a fit.</p>

    <section class="grid" style="margin-top:14px">
      <div>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Carefully-paced anxiety work</h3>
          <p class="muted">Support for persistent worry, performance anxiety, or situational stresses. We co-create practices you can use between sessions and prioritize exposure that feels manageable.</p>
          <h3 style="margin-top:12px">Low mood & motivation</h3>
          <p class="muted">Practical, behavioral steps paired with reflective work on meaning and energy. I help you find small, dependable shifts rather than all-or-nothing goals.</p>
          <h3 style="margin-top:12px">Relationship patterns</h3>
          <p class="muted">From communication habits to boundary-setting, we look at interaction cycles and rehearse alternatives you can try outside sessions.</p>
          <h3 style="margin-top:12px">Transitions & role changes</h3>
          <p class="muted">Support through moves, career shifts, parenting changes, and other transitions. We focus on stabilizing routines and clarifying values.</p>
          <h3 style="margin-top:12px">Focused series for specific aims</h3>
          <p class="muted">Short, structured programs address sleep, emotion regulation, or decision clarity. These are time-limited and skill-oriented.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h3>Membership options and framing</h3>
          <p class="muted">Rather than single blocks, many clients choose an ongoing plan. I offer clear tiers so you can pick the rhythm that fits your life.</p>
          <div class="tiers">
            <div class="tier">
              <h4>Stabilize Circle</h4>
              <p class="small">Biweekly sessions, access to short courses, messaging for scheduling.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tier">
              <h4>Steady Circle</h4>
              <p class="small">Weekly sessions, course access, periodic check-ins between sessions.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tier">
              <h4>Focused Series</h4>
              <p class="small">4–8 session concentrated programs for a specific goal; clear start and end.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cta-row"><a class="primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Begin a membership conversation</a></div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Quick intake exercise</h3>
          <p class="small">Use this short checklist to see which areas feel most pressing. The result produces questions you can take to the first appointment.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <label><input type="checkbox" class="chk" value="Anxiety"> Anxiety or excessive worry</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" class="chk" value="Low mood"> Low mood / lack of interest</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" class="chk" value="Relationships"> Relationship patterns</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" class="chk" value="Transitions"> Life transitions</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" class="chk" value="Sleep"> Sleep problems</label>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px">
            <button class="primary" id="summarize">Create note</button>
            <button class="secondary" id="clearChk">Clear</button>
          </div>
          <div class="output" id="chkOutput">Your concise note will appear here.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h3>Bring to session</h3>
          <p class="small">If you have questions about fit, timing, or approach, list them here and bring them to our consult.</p>
          <textarea id="bring" rows="6" placeholder="Questions for the clinician..." style="width:100%;margin-top:8px;border-radius:8px;padding:10px"></textarea>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px"><button class="primary" id="copyBring">Copy text</button></div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <p class="small" style="margin-top:14px">Limitations: This page is informational and not a substitute for clinical assessment. If you are at immediate risk, please contact local emergency services or a crisis line. Confidential contact: {{PHONE}} • {{EMAIL}}</p>
  </main>

  <script>
    // checklist summarizer
    document.getElementById('summarize').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const checks = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.chk:checked')).map(n=>n.value);
      const out = document.getElementById('chkOutput');
      if(!checks.length){ out.textContent = 'No areas selected.'; return; }
      const note = 'Primary concerns: ' + checks.join(', ') + '\nI would like to talk about: ' + checks.slice(0,3).join(', ') + '.';
      out.textContent = note;
    });
    document.getElementById('clearChk').addEventListener('click', function(){
      document.querySelectorAll('.chk').forEach(c=>c.checked=false);
      document.getElementById('chkOutput').textContent = 'Your concise note will appear here.';
    });

    // Copy questions to bring
    document.getElementById('copyBring').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const text = document.getElementById('bring').value.trim();
      if(!text) return;
      navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(()=>{
        this.textContent = 'Copied';
        setTimeout(()=>this.textContent='Copy text',1200);
      });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"approach.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>How I Work — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#F3ECE2;--card:#FFFFFF;--accent:#5A3F2B;--muted:#85756B;--ink:#2E2A25}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}
    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px}
    header{padding:12px 0}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px}
    nav a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:10px}
    h1{color:var(--accent);margin:4px 0 8px}
    h2{margin:12px 0 6px}
    p{margin:0}
    .steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
    .step{padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid var(--accent);background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(90,63,43,0.02),transparent)}
    .widget{margin-top:12px}
    input,select,textarea{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(46,42,37,0.08)}
    button.primary{background:var(--accent);color:white;border:none;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}
    .output{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#FEF7EE;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:8px;border:1px dashed rgba(46,42,37,0.06)}
    @media(min-width:820px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 360px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="specialties.html">Areas</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
        <a href="fees.html">Fees</a>
        <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
        <a href="book.html">Start</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="grid">
      <div>
        <article class="card">
          <h1>How I work with clients</h1>
          <p class="muted">My approach blends focused skills, collaborative formulation, and steady review. I aim for clarity in each session so you leave with one or two things to try between meetings.</p>

          <section style="margin-top:14px">
            <h2>Process overview</h2>
            <div class="steps">
              <div class="step"><strong>1. Orientation.</strong> We start by clarifying immediate concerns, what you’d like to change, and any constraints in your schedule or energy.</div>
              <div class="step"><strong>2. Formulation.</strong> A short, shared understanding of the patterns sustaining the difficulty—this is collaborative, not a label.</div>
              <div class="step"><strong>3. Plan.</strong> Practical, measurable steps and experiments to test between sessions. Plans are small and specific.</div>
              <div class="step"><strong>4. Review & adjust.</strong> We track what worked, refine strategies, and move the focus as things shift.</div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section style="margin-top:12px">
            <h2>Methods I commonly use</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>Problem-focused CBT strategies when helpful for patterns and habits</li>
              <li>Behavioral activation for low motivation and mood</li>
              <li>Skills training for emotion regulation and distress tolerance</li>
              <li>Reflective work to situate symptoms within life story and values</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section style="margin-top:12px">
            <h2>What to expect in the first session</h2>
            <p class="muted">We’ll review your intake, prioritize the first session goals, and agree on a short plan. I will explain confidentiality, session logistics, and the membership options if you want ongoing care.</p>
          </section>

        </article>

        <article class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h2>Boundaries & crisis information</h2>
          <p class="muted">I provide scheduled clinical care and am not available for on-call crisis response. If you are in immediate danger, please contact emergency services or a local crisis line. Confidentiality follows standard clinical limits and will be explained at the first visit.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Session Planner</h2>
          <p class="small">Sketch a short agenda for a first few visits and copy a plain-text summary to bring to the consult.</p>
          <div class="widget">
            <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
              <label>One-sentence focus</label>
              <input id="one" type="text" placeholder="e.g., reduce evening worry, improve sleep"/>
              <label>Top skill to learn</label>
              <select id="skill"><option>Emotion regulation</option><option>Boundary setting</option><option>Behavioral activation</option><option>Problem solving</option></select>
              <label>Preferred meeting rhythm</label>
              <select id="rhythm"><option>Weekly</option><option>Biweekly</option></select>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:6px"><button class="primary" id="makePlan">Make note</button><button class="secondary" id="resetPlan">Reset</button></div>
              <div class="output" id="planNote">Plan will appear here.</div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px"><button class="primary" id="copyNote">Copy</button></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h2>Self-Screening Guide</h2>
          <p class="small">A brief, reflective sequence that produces three topics you might bring to the first meeting.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
            <label>Rate how much these affect you (1-4)</label>
            <div>
              <div><label>Work stress <input type="range" id="r1" min="1" max="4" value="1" /></label></div>
